          "text": "{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d check the January 1 Alaska award lead first, if that date works for you: it reports fewer Alaska points than the January 7 lead, with the same reported fees. The main tradeoff is that neither lead includes a flight schedule, so these are not complete itineraries and the timing and routing still need checking. The search results are partial, so they do not establish the full set of possibilities.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A3@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"January 1 Alaska award lead\",\"v\":\"This SFO–BKK economy award summary reports 42,500 Alaska points and USD 50.90 in award taxes and fees. Its reported quote scope is unknown, so the fee amount is not established as a per-person or all-in amount. It reports 8 seats, but that does not confirm current availability or that the award supports your one-traveler request; no returned traveler count is provided. The schedule is date-only, with no itinerary details.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A21@2027-01-07/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"January 7 Alaska award lead\",\"v\":\"This is another date-only SFO–BKK economy award summary, reporting 50,000 Alaska points, USD 50.90 in award taxes and fees, and 8 seats. Compared with the January 1 lead, it reports 7,500 more points in the same program, while the reported fee amount and seat count are the same. Its quote scope is unknown, no returned traveler count is provided, and the schedule and itinerary details are absent.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-01T22:55-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash reference: January 1 via Hong Kong\",\"v\":\"The cash search result shows a Cathay Pacific itinerary with one stop, departing SFO at 10:55 p.m. local time on January 1 and arriving in Bangkok at 10:35 a.m. local time on January 4; reported elapsed time is 44 hours 40 minutes. Its source quote is USD 640.00, but the quote scope is unknown. The result returned one traveler, which does not establish the quote’s scope or make it directly comparable to the award-tax quotes.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"There is no complete award journey among the selected results. The useful next check is whether January 1 works for you and whether the Alaska award can be confirmed with its full schedule and current availability; if not, check January 7 on the same terms. The cash itinerary is a separate baseline, not a like-for-like total-cost comparison with either award lead.\"}]}",
